- stats: stats, circleStats
- text: topLineText, sideLineText
- steps: processSteps, stepsWithArrow, arrows
- visual: imagesText, iconsText
- quotes: speechBubbles, quoteBoxes
Max families per deck: 5
Use ONLY variants from the allowed list. The art direction above tells you WHICH to pick and WHEN.

