## GML Examples
# Classic — GML Examples

Reference cards showing what good Classic GML looks like.

## Title card (image right, sparse)

```html
<SECTION image-layout="right">
  <IMG class="accent-image" query="modern analytics dashboard with flowing data visualization" />
  <DIV class="body">
    <H1>RetainIQ</H1>
    <P>ML-powered customer churn prediction that turns at-risk accounts into retained revenue.</P>
  </DIV>
</SECTION>
```

